Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.48,0:00:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,空间和物质的无限延伸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a vast expanse of space and matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.12,0:00:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,包含着我们所见及所知的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It includes all that we see, and all that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.84,0:00:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,从一开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the beginning of time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.84,0:01:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就想知道它从何而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have wondered how it came to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一场壮丽的精心安排？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gloriously orchestrated plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.32,0:01:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一系列巧合？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A chance series of events?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是什么不能更蠢的理由？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or something much, much dumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.16,0:01:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,噫！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:20.88,Title,0,0,0,0,,《冰川时代5：星际碰撞》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是美好的一天…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a beautiful day out here on the ice…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.12,0:05:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,父女齐聚冰上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}as father meets daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,参加一场别开生面的冰球争霸赛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a quest for hockey supremacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.92,0:05:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,选手是桃子对曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Peaches meets Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛犸象对猛犸象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mammoth meets mammoth.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛长牙对猛长牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mano a mano.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛大象对猛小象{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meema me moo-ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛爸爸对猛女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama may mee-mee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩能不能安静点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you two quit it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}M-okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,猛小气鬼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meanie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,进击的猛犸象带着球长驱直入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blazing mammoth takes it on the breakaway.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.28,0:05:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没有一位球员能如此坚强 如此优雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's never been a player so tough, so graceful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.12,0:05:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此渴望得分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So desperate to score.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.92,0:05:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他假装向右 假装向左{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fakes right. He fakes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.28,0:05:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他假装知道怎么玩曲棍球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fakes knowing how to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？怎么啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢什么东西啦？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我闻到哪里来的臭味？是曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's that stink I smell out there? It's Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.68,0:06:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 是曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. It's Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.76,0:06:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,吼！你太臭啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! You stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.96,0:06:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 小毛球 让我看看你的能耐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Fuzzball. Let's see what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是你自找的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！她又进球啦！又进啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! She dominates! Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 拜托 我对你可是很温柔的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please. I went easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.20,0:06:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫好的育儿方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called good parenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了吧 面对现实吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right. Face it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我才是冰上王者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I rule the ice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.72,0:06:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你口气倒不小啊 小高手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you talk a big game, hotshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.04,0:06:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 三局两胜怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, how about best of three?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦吼！触地得分！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Yes! Touchdown!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 不对 不是触地得分 那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no, that's not right. Not touchdown. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.32,0:06:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 一杆进洞！喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hole-in-one! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安！哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.80,0:06:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我刚刚得分了！你看到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, I scored! Did you see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.80,0:06:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到啦！你简直棒呆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! And you were amazing. Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.64,0:06:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这冰可太滑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the ice is really icy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.08,0:06:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直超级过度滑溜溜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like super-sized, extra value icy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我滑得更好了 对吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm getting better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.72,0:06:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.00,0:07:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们… 等下再玩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we'll play… later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.68,0:07:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她又把你打得屁滚尿流了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, she whupped your butt again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.20,0:07:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且你这屁股的块头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with a butt that size,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是够你翻滚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's a whole lot of whuppin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人被打得屁滚尿流 也没人翻滚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody was whupped. There was no whupping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:12.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是一个慈祥的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a loving father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在跟她唯一的女儿讨论战术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sharing some strategy with his only daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.24,0:07:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道烂水平也能称为战术{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know sucking was a strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 轮到我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's our turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.84,0:07:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们看看好球该怎么打！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's show them how it's done!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.56,0:07:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要输惨了 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going down, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哒哒嗒嗒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-ta-da-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你的 我亲爱的岳母{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, my mom-in-law-to-be.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.04,0:07:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,金盏花！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buttercups!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.20,0:07:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自大自然的阳光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nature's sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阳光本来不就属于大自然的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't sunshine nature's sunshine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢！朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! Thank you, Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.88,0:07:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经很久没人送过我花了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been so long since anyone's given me flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:46.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你要娶的是我们的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're marrying our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用总是给我们带礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to keep bringing us presents.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我觉得很开心啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.56,0:07:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有给你的 我的导师 偶像 最崇敬的猛犸象…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you, my guru, my rock, my main mammoth…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把最好的礼物给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To you, I give the greatest gift of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.28,0:08:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我的老丈人 来个拥抱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Bro-Dad. Bring it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感受到你的心跳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel your heart beating.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.56,0:08:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's enough of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好习惯习惯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们将来可是要住我们隔壁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be living right next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 朱利安 要走吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Julian. Wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.44,0:08:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 你能不能帮帮我那件事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, weren't you gonna help me with the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.44,0:08:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！没错 那件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Right. The thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.08,0:08:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去做那件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gotta do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.32,0:08:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以做那件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.60,0:08:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是女孩子之间的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a girl thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你们干嘛不去做点男孩子之间的事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Why don't you go do a guy thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.84,0:08:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经很久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you don't spend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没跟你的朋友们好好玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nearly enough time with your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有吗？- 我们等会儿再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't? - I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个特殊的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On this special day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们说了我们的决定了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you told them about our decision yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.60,0:08:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没 我想等个合适的时机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm waiting for the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 罗密欧 跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Romeo. Walk with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.44,0:08:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备去看看蝴蝶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna watch some butterflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,破茧而出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}come out of their cocoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哇哦！真的吗？- 假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whoa! Really? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜 宝贝儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！我记得以前我跟曼尼也是这样的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw! I remember when Manny and I used to be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是！爱上他们 离开他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me! Love them and leave them,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.32,0:09:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后带走一半的财产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take half of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的准则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my motto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 曾经有无数女人妄想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mi amor, so many ladies have tried and failed…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.40,0:09:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我希德这匹野马安上缰绳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to strap a saddle on Sid the stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我只想和你分享我的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I want to share everything with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是我身上的跳蚤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the wind beneath my fleas,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼里的水藻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the algae of my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意和我共度余生吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you be my mate for life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.20,0:09:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 希德？- 嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sidney? - Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德 你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sidney, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.04,0:09:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问你一件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意嫁…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you marry…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德 我要就此打断你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid, I'm gonna stop you right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.72,0:09:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和你分手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm breaking up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？但我都计划好我们的未来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? But I planned our whole future!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.36,0:09:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的墓地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our burial plots.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:09:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还请了个乐队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even hired a band.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.36,0:10:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 现在不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.84,0:10:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？我们才约会了一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy? We've only had one date.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且只持续了14分钟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lasted 14 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但我觉得像过了20分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but it felt like 20.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！戒指？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't! A ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢戒指 但是不能嫁给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I like the ring, but no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你太粘人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't. You're too clingy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哪里粘人了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is this clingy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.60,0:10:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且顺便说下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.92,0:10:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟照片上长得一点都不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look nothing like your profile picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗朗辛 你得开始和{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francine, you gotta start dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.96,0:10:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他物种约会了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}outside of your species.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.28,0:10:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,小辛辛 我们再好好谈谈 是因为那个比基尼吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franny, we can work this out. Is this about the bikini? Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道那是毒藤做的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know it was poison ivy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,小辛辛 小辛辛 救命啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Franny. Franny, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.92,0:10:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的眼睛受伤了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it the eyes that hurt…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我的灵魂？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or my soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.24,0:10:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是我的眼睛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.56,0:10:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 女人啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, women!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.92,0:10:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 女人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.00,0:11:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.08,0:11:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不理解她们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.40,0:11:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如说 艾丽 和她在一起的生活非常棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, Ellie. Life's great with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有惊喜 没有变化{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no surprises. Nothing ever changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.16,0:11:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今天 她傻笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then today, she giggled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉会傻笑吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Shira ever just giggle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.28,0:11:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你别吃我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.32,0:11:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 希拉不是那种爱傻笑的虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Shira's not a big giggler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 艾丽傻笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Ellie giggled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后她就开始来回摇摆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then she wiggled.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,「嘻嘻嘻嘻」 砰！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tee hee hee hee." Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.32,0:11:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真不知道为什么她表现得这么奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea why she's acting so weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.64,0:11:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.16,0:11:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.52,0:11:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And speaking of weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.88,0:11:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有人吗？哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody there? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马可？波罗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marco? Polo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.32,0:11:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 嗨 曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hi, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃！口气这么大你该刷刷牙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ew! Your breath is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.88,0:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 一切安好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, nothing. Everything's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒呆 无比美妙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fabulous. Zippity-dippity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.20,0:11:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我猜猜 她把你甩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me guess. She dumped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.88,0:11:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做错了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.56,0:11:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都有另一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody has somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我却只有我年轻俊秀的容颜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all I've got is my boyish good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.56,0:12:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,和这个墨西哥流浪乐队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this mariachi band.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！好痒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! So itchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 带你去洗洗干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's get you cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的不过是真爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted is true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.00,0:14:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要求过分吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that too much to ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么如此安静？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为世界都在为我默哀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the world is mourning my loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都去哪儿了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.32,0:15:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.68,0:15:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗒哒！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,结婚纪念日快乐 亲爱的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy Anniversary, honey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,纪念日？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anniversary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不 她们说的是这件事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. That's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.00,0:15:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了！现在轮到你了 我的老丈人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Now it's your turn, Bro-Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.68,0:15:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！我们想看看你给艾丽准备了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! We wanna see what you got Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.56,0:15:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！曼尼！曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny! Manny! Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.24,0:15:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,再向艾丽求婚一次怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about another hand for Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他忘了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.36,0:15:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真为艾丽难过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so bad for Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 我… 呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, I… Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.88,0:16:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没忘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼真的好爱她！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how big Manny's love is for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这烟火真够及时的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice save with the light show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.92,0:16:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你放的？那是谁放的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you didn't do this? Then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.12,0:16:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.80,0:16:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真担心你忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so afraid you'd forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.08,0:16:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你竟然为我点亮整片天空？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you lit up the sky for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.28,0:16:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 那个…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术师从不揭开他的奥秘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A magician never reveals his secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常在这儿想象我们未来的宝宝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep picturing our own kid in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.96,0:16:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定是最棒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be the best one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.64,0:16:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你说的是 「她」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you meant "she."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.44,0:16:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以吧 不说这个了 迪亚哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we've been over this, Diego.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.76,0:16:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小孩子都害怕我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are afraid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是为什么呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.52,0:16:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要吃了我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they gonna eat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:16:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.84,0:17:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我甚至都微笑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even smiled this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是最好的礼物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best present ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 你简直是婚姻中的模范{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, sir, are an education in marital excellence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了之后会很想念你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really gonna miss you guys when we leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 其实 我还没有告诉他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, actually, I haven't told them yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.32,0:17:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,惊喜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.12,0:17:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要走了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们头几年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you guys were gonna live with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.68,0:17:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会和我们住在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the first couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是朱利安和我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. But Julian and I.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.92,0:17:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要出去闯荡一阵子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}kind of want to roam for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闯荡？- 没错！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Roam? - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.68,0:17:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,旅行 探险 到处去玩儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Travel, explore, just go wherever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.84,0:17:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有计划就是最好的计划 这就是我的人生哲学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No plan is the best plan. That's my philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.48,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点儿点心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hors d'oeuvres?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.60,0:17:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是什么计划 也不是什么哲学…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a plan, or a philosophy…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很不安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or very safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.52,0:17:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸 我们还年轻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, we're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我们到了你和老妈一样喜欢平淡的年纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can worry about being safe when we're old and boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来讨论安全问题吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you and Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.84,0:17:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们觉得我们应该就… - 抱歉！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think we should just… - Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是家庭会议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a family discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.52,0:18:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我不是其中一份子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But aren't I part of your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在还不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得那个有什么问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that look like a problem to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.44,0:18:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个火球径直朝我们飞来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A ball of fire heading directly towards us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有什么问题？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would that be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.36,0:18:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你跌到沟里失去记忆怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you fall in a ditch and get amnesia?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.00,0:18:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼 我们有麻烦了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, we have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.56,0:18:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候 我自己的麻烦都没解决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now. I have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.28,0:18:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的这个麻烦比较严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's a little bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.52,0:18:27.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可不觉得 - 曼尼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't think so. - Manny!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.12,0:18:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼 你怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.56,0:18:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 宴会结束了 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, okay. Party's over, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.32,0:18:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安 大家都散了吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good night. And leave right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？宴会才刚刚开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? The party just got started.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.96,0:18:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我有点困了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting kind of sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.40,0:18:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都走吧 卧倒 最好找个地方躲起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone should go. And duck. Possibly cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:19:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看！又来了好多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! There's more coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星雨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meteor shower!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.24,0:19:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,流星？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meteor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼的爱要害死我们了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny's love is killing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.60,0:19:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这些都是你为我准备的惊喜？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose this is all part of your magic show for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.48,0:19:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉拉能量？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abracadabra?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能待会再讨论这事吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you guys deal with this later?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们得找个地方躲起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. We need to take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.68,0:19:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮油！看我的火球！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,矮油！我也有！我们是酷鼠兄弟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo-hoo! Me too! We're smoking hot, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两家伙是我们的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们没事吧？数数我有几根象牙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? How many tusks do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.92,0:19:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,树{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,三个？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！小心树！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.12,0:19:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,各就各位 跳！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有个洞穴！快进去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave! Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！快点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.88,0:20:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 宝贝 爸爸在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, sweetheart. Daddy's…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.84,0:20:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像情况好转了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it sounds like it's slowing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.12,0:20:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我确定一切都结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup, it's definitely over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我们应该考虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might wanna think.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,到地下住一段时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}about moving underground for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧啊！我弄到了一个蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that! I got an egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄到过几个蛋呢 小弟？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many eggs did you poach, little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.04,0:21:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须得偷别人的蛋吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to steal other creatures' eggs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.68,0:21:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道我们就不能就吃素食？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, couldn't we just go vegan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们可以吃素食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, we could eat vegans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.16,0:21:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 有时候我都怀疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, sometimes I wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.16,0:21:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们亲生的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how you snuck into this family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 费加罗 费加罗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Figaro, Figaro ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.44,0:21:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 费加罗 费加罗 费加罗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Figaro, Figaro, Figaro ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我一分钟 我得涂点肥皂洗洗干净{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you in a minute. I'll have to rinse and repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.68,0:21:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只黄鼠狼真让人扫兴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That weasel is such a buzzkill.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.00,0:21:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.36,0:21:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会帮你找回你的蛋蛋的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll catch the crew that poached your egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.80,0:21:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥真是一语双关啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.44,0:21:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的机智之眼在眼罩下眨了眨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm winking under the eye patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一位母亲正因失去孩子悲痛欲绝 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ A mother is crying a damsel in distress ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要说窃贼们造成这样的混乱 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Foreboding intruders have made such a mess ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:21:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 对我来说就是不尊重 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What I detect is a lack of respect ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我是这个迷失世界的小小守护者 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ For all that is precious and dear ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.48,0:22:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 守护一切宝贝 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I am the pint-sized protector of this lost world ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.20,0:22:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我的小伙伴们都叫我巴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my friends call me Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.84,0:22:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得不错 伙计们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.60,0:22:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我可警告你们 这里不欢迎欺凌 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I have a message, bullies not welcome ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 把你们所盗之物物归原主 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Return what you've stolen ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.00,0:22:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 打哪来 回哪去 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Go back where you came from ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你知道我功夫了得 别做无谓的挣扎 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You know I'm greater, so don't be a hater ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 你魔高一尺 我道高一丈 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You may be Jurassic, but I am fantastic ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.04,0:22:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 费加罗 费加罗 费加罗 费加罗 费加罗 费加罗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Figaro, Figaro, Figaro, Figaro, Figaro, Figaro ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 费加罗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Figaro ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这尾音超棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, love that bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.36,0:22:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 奔跑 攀爬 旋转 微笑 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Running and climbing And spinning and grinning ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.80,0:22:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 疾奔 猛冲 闪避 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And dashing and diving and dodging ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.92,0:22:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 滑行 滑翔 努力生存 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And sliding and gliding and staying alive ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.36,0:22:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 还有一些事儿 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And these are a few of the things ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.44,0:22:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我要在午餐之前搞定 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ That I do before lunch ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 不怕危险 不畏死亡 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Death defying Danger denying ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.84,0:22:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我在飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 或许你会觉得我疯了 可是人生不能重来 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ You might think I'm mad. But, hey, you only live once ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.68,0:22:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 无需感谢我 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ No need to thank me ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.68,0:22:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 但若你坚持 我也不会拒绝 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ But if you insist, I won't resist ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.88,0:22:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁身上那么臭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who smells like fish?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.08,0:22:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,都坐坐好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Hold on to your butts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.20,0:22:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 下 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Class ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.60,0:23:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 课！∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dismissed ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.88,0:23:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.88,0:23:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you are, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走！我去把他们引开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! I'll lead them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.84,0:23:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才多有意思啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周同一时间同一地点我们再来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same time, same place, next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.60,0:23:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toodles!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜你 黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations, weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.60,0:23:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的死期到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just signed your death warrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.28,0:23:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄鼠狼式谢幕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weaseled my way out of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.96,0:23:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些闪闪发光的是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. What's all that flash and dazzle about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.92,0:23:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁在深林里放这么块石头？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who puts a rock in the middle of the jungle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.60,0:24:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.64,0:25:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.56,0:26:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.24,0:26:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好啊 哺乳动物们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Hello, mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.32,0:26:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 巴克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Buck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.64,0:26:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.48,0:26:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 巴克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Buck!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.28,0:26:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, a little help.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,正中脾脏！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on the spleen!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.40,0:26:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这货虽然没什么用处 可还是很疼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Utterly useless, but totally hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.76,0:26:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克老兄 欢迎回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Buck. Welcome back, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.36,0:26:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下 这只麻花状生物就是恐龙克星？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. This half-a-snack is the dinosaur whisperer?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是一名专业舞蹈家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And expert salsa dancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.92,0:26:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然我少了只眼睛 但是我有一口好牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one eye but all my original teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.24,0:26:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要数数吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to count them? Ah…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.28,0:26:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 谢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.60,0:26:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位姑娘一定就是油桃了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this must be Nectarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.84,0:26:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫… 桃子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.20,0:26:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个意思啦 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Semantics, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.48,0:26:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很荣幸能见到你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am deeply honored.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这眼罩真不错 痞气十足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet eye patch. Very gangsta.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢这孩子 - 巴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I like this kid. - Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.24,0:26:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我… 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I… What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在努力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你要怎么告诉别人他们完蛋了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do you tell someone they're doomed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.80,0:27:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被难住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's stumped.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.76,0:27:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不是完蛋了 巴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not doomed, Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一场流星雨 现在已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just a meteor shower, and the show's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.68,0:27:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反 老伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, quite the contrary, old chap.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.12,0:27:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.40,0:27:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了一则预言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, I found a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.44,0:27:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,停一停好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.32,0:27:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 他真是扫兴大王 不觉得吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, he really sucks the fun out of everything. Doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.56,0:27:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫兴大王！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fun sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.08,0:27:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把这个碑从头到尾的读了一遍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read this tablet front to back.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面的故事非常让人不安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the story it tells is very disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.04,0:27:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多每隔一亿年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every hundred million years or so,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界就会发生一场宇宙大清洗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world gets a cosmic cleansing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.76,0:27:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在恐龙之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the dinosaurs,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.16,0:27:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活着一些像马蹄蟹一样的生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}there were these horseshoe crab-looking thingies.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.24,0:27:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh! Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.64,0:27:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然有一天 这座山脉的底部{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, at the bottom of this mountain range,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,被行星击中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}an asteroid hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣！再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom! Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.32,0:27:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 恐龙 山脉 行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next, dinosaurs, mountain range, asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.60,0:27:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘣！再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom! Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.12,0:27:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来会发生的事 哺乳动物们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And coming up next, mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.48,0:28:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,山脉 行星 嘣！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mountain range, asteroid, boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.96,0:28:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.56,0:28:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,愚蠢的哺乳动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是哺乳动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.68,0:28:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 她来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, and there she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.80,0:28:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行星之母正嘶吼着朝我们冲来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mother of all asteroids screaming towards us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.84,0:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次即使躲到地下去也没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even going underground won't save us this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前没有这东西的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that wasn't there before.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.00,0:28:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看天上都变什么样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look what it's doing to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.08,0:28:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 因为我有一个主意了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No worries. Because I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.48,0:28:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？去阻止一颗行星？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? To stop an asteroid?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.60,0:28:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 上两颗行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the last two asteroids.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.72,0:28:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是在地球上的同一地点爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have pummeled the earth in the same spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.88,0:28:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次也会一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's about to happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.96,0:28:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得到那儿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.56,0:28:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看到底是什么在吸引行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see what's attracting the asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.76,0:28:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦我们知道为什么它会来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once we know why it's coming…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.48,0:28:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就能找到办法把它送到别处去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can figure out how to send it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.88,0:28:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划太蠢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That plan is so dumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是它长张脸 我非把它打得找不着北{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish it had a face so I could smack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.92,0:28:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来整理下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.16,0:28:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不但不要离这颗致命行星越远越好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of running away from a deadly asteroid…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.76,0:28:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,反之 你还要我们径直前往危险中心？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you want us to run directly towards it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这主意听起来不理想 可好消是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds suboptimal, but the good news is…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管我们去哪儿都是死路一条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll kill us no matter where we went.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我就放心了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.40,0:29:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可是就算我们到达了撞击地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but even if we get to the crash site…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.88,0:29:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又要怎么去改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.40,0:29:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经刻在石碑上的预言呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is literally written in stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.20,0:29:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,悲观的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, my cynical friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.24,0:29:12.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽说恐龙被行星从地表抹去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dinos were wiped off the face of the Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.36,0:29:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是还是有些死里逃生了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们改变了自己的命运 我们也能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They changed their fate and we can change ours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.24,0:29:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要和我一起去？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.52,0:29:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们怎么想？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.60,0:29:26.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我觉得黄鼠狼是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I'm worried the weasel's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.88,0:29:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！不能相信黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't listen to the weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.12,0:29:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是个神志不清的疯子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a raving loon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.76,0:29:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我比较喜欢扮演内心小恶魔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I just love playing devil's advocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,还喜欢打扮得美美的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And looking fabulous!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.56,0:29:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克曾救过我们的命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Buck has saved our lives before, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:44.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果这次他救不了我们呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what if he can't this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.28,0:29:45.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该相信什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.00,0:29:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕我们的生命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm afraid our lives will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.64,0:29:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,未曾绽放就要枯萎了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.32,0:29:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.64,0:29:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.08,0:30:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喀什和艾迪奉命前来报道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crash and Eddie reporting for duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.48,0:30:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,粪命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doody.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.04,0:30:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！脏话说的不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellent! And dirty word processed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.80,0:30:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我们最好上路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we better get on the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.88,0:30:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为时间紧迫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because time till impact is roughly…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.08,0:30:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩下2天4小时1分钟16秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}2 days, 4 hours, 1 minute and 16 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.40,0:30:14.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,15秒 14秒…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 seconds, 14 seconds…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.72,0:30:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.36,0:30:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们大家都明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we're all gonna get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看起来太帅了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! We look so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.88,0:30:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么东西？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh. What is this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.52,0:31:00.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿？一旦让我逮到那只独眼黄鼠狼…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? When I am through with that one-eyed weasel…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.44,0:31:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就要变成无眼黄鼠狼了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to need two eye patches.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.20,0:31:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欣赏你的残暴 格蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your bloodthirstitude, Gertie.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.60,0:31:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是你听到他们的对话了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you heard them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,行星就要来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An asteroid is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.96,0:31:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切就要因此而改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This changes things.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.48,0:31:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！这里真是冷死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy snowballs! It's freezing up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.88,0:31:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都缩成一团了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parts are retracting into other parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.24,0:31:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能别再像只小鹦鹉一样吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please stop acting like a parakeet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.24,0:31:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好你遗传了你妈妈的眼睛…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a good thing you got your mother's eyes…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.68,0:31:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然你真是一无是处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you'd be totally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话太伤人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's just hurtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.88,0:31:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见什么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一无所获 一无所获{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.40,0:31:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命的行星朝我们奔腾而来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deadly asteroid screaming towards Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.40,0:31:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下！看见他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.28,0:31:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了 他离我们好远{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad. He is really far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.40,0:31:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算飞行也赶不上他了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably too far to reach by flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.20,0:31:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 我们还是回家吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. Let's just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能撤退！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not retreating!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那只黄鼠狼来到之前…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until that weasel came along…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.84,0:31:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一家人一直本本分分的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our family made an honest living.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.00,0:31:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷着蛋过日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stealing dino eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.36,0:31:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,诚实的谋生手段 偷窃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An honest living. Stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.76,0:32:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点讽刺 你不觉得么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of ironic, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.56,0:32:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 为什么要干掉那只黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, why take out the weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.88,0:32:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正小行星迟早要把我们都干掉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the asteroid is just gonna take us out?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.88,0:32:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然你看的远 但是你的目光很短浅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much sight. So little vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.56,0:32:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们阻止了那只黄鼠狼和他的朋友们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stop the weasel and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.96,0:32:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不让他们改变小行星的路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}from diverting the asteroid…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.80,0:32:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kablooie!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.88,0:32:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会杀死那只黄鼠狼和所有的其他人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills the weasel and everyone else…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.60,0:32:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们可以飞上天空高枕无忧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we glide safely above it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.60,0:32:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是我们的天堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be our paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.68,0:32:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不太现实{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's seems highly implausible.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.48,0:32:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,从科学的角度说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just from a scientific standpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.08,0:32:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 真是个好主意 哈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. It's a great plan. Dynamite!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.84,0:32:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是我听过的三四个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the top three or four.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.00,0:32:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,物种灭绝计划中最棒的一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}species annihilation plans I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.92,0:32:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么听起来就好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.36,0:32:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们确保小行星撞上地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's make sure that asteroid hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.64,0:32:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么我们不能像正常的家庭一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't we just fear the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.44,0:32:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,畏惧世界末日？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a normal family?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.16,0:33:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.40,0:33:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.64,0:33:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 巴克？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Buck?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.80,0:34:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每块岩石都蕴含着一个故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All rocks tell a tale.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.44,0:34:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从哪里来还有我们要到哪里去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we've been and where we're heading.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.68,0:34:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.32,0:34:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而 那个 是一坨屎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, however, is a turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.12,0:34:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你知道如果我们没能成功…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that if we don't make it…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.40,0:34:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们永远不能结婚…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we never get married…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.72,0:34:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的唯一{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were the only one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 振作起来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.64,0:34:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们当然会成功 而且我们会结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course we'll make it, and we will get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.52,0:34:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是也许宇宙在告诉我们 不会结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe it's the universe telling us we won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.12,0:35:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！哇哦！哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.44,0:35:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会让一个小小的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to let one tiny little…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.96,0:35:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,300英里宽的迷你小行星搞砸你们的计划？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}300-mile-wide asteroid ruin your plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.16,0:35:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如明天都没有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we think about our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.48,0:35:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么能计划未来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}when we may not have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.00,0:35:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我们会阻止这一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, we're going to stop this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会结婚的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哒哒哒 吧嗒崩！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bada-bing, bada-boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.88,0:35:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不会爆炸 忘记我说的那个崩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, not boom. Forget I said boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.64,0:35:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了！我来做你们的婚礼策划人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know! I'll be your wedding planner!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.16,0:35:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们注意力从{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll take your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.52,0:35:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界末日转移到别处去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}off all this end-of-the-world stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.44,0:35:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我们刚刚打算跳过这个环节！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, we were just gonna wing it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.92,0:35:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,低调一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it low-key.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.08,0:35:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.68,0:35:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子 桃子 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches, Peaches. Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.44,0:35:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能这么跳过你人生中最开心的一天！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't just wing the happiest day of your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.40,0:35:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可以 你应该抓紧并且珍视它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you seize it and you cherish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.52,0:35:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带着美好的目标抓紧它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You strangle it with good intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 让我们从你的发型开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Let's start with your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,往上梳扎个丸子头？很传统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Updo with a top bun? Traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.84,0:35:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是往下梳然后扎一个鱼尾辫 很俏皮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or updo with a fishtail braid. Flirtatious.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是有点俗套{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But maybe a little trashy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.00,0:35:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.44,0:35:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有！吊袜带！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And garter belts!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.44,0:36:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪是蕾丝雏菊版模特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, Ed is modelling laced daisies.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.24,0:36:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而喀什展现的是更优雅的常春藤…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While Crash is rocking a more elegant ivy…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.80,0:36:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过小腿要够美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all about the calves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.88,0:36:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我们需要一张座位表！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. We need a seating chart!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.68,0:36:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,单身的坐一桌 孩子们坐一桌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The singles table, the kids table,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.08,0:36:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪的亲戚们坐一桌…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the weird relatives table…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.60,0:36:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,体味重的坐一桌 再加两桌体味重的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the smelly table, two more smelly tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.76,0:36:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.12,0:36:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你们一定会喜欢的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're gonna love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.76,0:36:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁像他那么走路？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who walks like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.48,0:36:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！看看我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.48,0:36:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.76,0:36:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管小行星了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget the asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.32,0:36:25.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拥抱我一下 岳父！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gimme a hug, Bro-Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.60,0:36:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 有只漂亮小鸟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that pretty bird there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊！确实挺漂亮 眼光不错 曼尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! That is a pretty bird. Good eye, Manny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.28,0:36:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.76,0:36:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,天都要塌下来了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sky is literally falling…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.20,0:36:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她却觉得我们只需要跟着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she thinks we're just gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.60,0:36:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个没计划 走路轻佻的家伙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}let her stroll into the wilderness…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.16,0:36:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起走进茫茫荒地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Mr. No Plans Bouncy Walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.16,0:36:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挑他的错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop picking on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.80,0:36:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 艾丽 你不是还在生我的气吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, El, you're not still mad at me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.68,0:36:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我不生气了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm not still mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.20,0:36:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不想这么度过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because that's not how I want to spend.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.80,0:36:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准是生命最后几天的日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what could be our final days together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.56,0:36:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们活下来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we somehow survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.16,0:36:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲过了那个毁灭我们星球的小行星…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that planet-killing hunk of space rock…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.16,0:36:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是会找你算账的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're in for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.32,0:36:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们活下来了 我们会失去我们的女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we survive, we lose our daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.68,0:36:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我也在想这个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've been thinking about that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.72,0:37:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.32,0:37:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我知道了！我们让他们分手 对么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I know! We destroy the relationship, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我们永远都不会让她走…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way we never have to let her go…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.56,0:37:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会永远做我们的小女儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she'll just stay our little girl forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.16,0:37:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你这个精神病！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you psychopath!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.16,0:37:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如我们劝他们住得离我们近一点？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we convince them to stay near us?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.80,0:37:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！这样更好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.00,0:37:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很喜欢 但是怎么办到呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.08,0:37:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,用让她照我们意愿做事的老办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way we always get her to do what we want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.24,0:37:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她觉得这是她自己的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We make her think it's her idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.92,0:37:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个狡猾的家伙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sneaky, sneaky minx!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿这招还管用吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just hope we haven't lost our touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.60,0:37:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.84,0:37:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 哺乳动物们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behold, mammals!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.56,0:37:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,小行星的一部分已经偷偷溜进来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sneak preview of the asteroid to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.68,0:37:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自太空的石头 从宇宙新鲜出炉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A space rock. Fresh from the cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.76,0:37:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm, mmm, mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.16,0:37:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尝到了铁 碳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I taste iron, carbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.56,0:37:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！还有一点点镍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And a hint of nickel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.08,0:37:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙尝起来很孤独{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space tastes lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.04,0:37:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 看！我又找到了一块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! I found another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.04,0:37:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.36,0:38:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！你的把我的吸住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Yours is attracted to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.04,0:38:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你的把我的吸住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Yours is attracted to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.80,0:38:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们太有吸引力了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just too attractive!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,力量惊人！最后活命的几个小时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupendous! Now we have something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.36,0:38:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有东西玩了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to play with during our final hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.56,0:38:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没领会到重点 老虎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're missing the point, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.20,0:38:19.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是有磁性的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.44,0:38:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这些来自太空的石头都有磁性…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if these space rocks are magnetic…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.76,0:38:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so is that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.32,0:38:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只能证明一个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.72,0:38:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that would be…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.48,0:38:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要介意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.88,0:38:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.72,0:38:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在我的头脑里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.08,0:38:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点冷啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Kind of chilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,绅士们 这是我们现在知道的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, here's what we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自太空的岩石？有磁性的 小行星？也是有磁性的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space rocks? Magnetic. Asteroid? Also, magnetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.96,0:38:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,著名的天体物理学家 尼尔·德巴克·黄鼠狼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Famed astrophysicist Neil deBuck Weasel!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.48,0:38:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很了解宇宙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows the cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.96,0:38:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据事实 还有人体工学…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ipso facto, thusly and ergo…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.44,0:38:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,撞击点一定还有很多这样的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the crash site must have a heap of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.52,0:39:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸引着小行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}attracting the asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.44,0:39:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕达哥拉斯巴克 他找到了正确的切入点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Pythagoras Buck. He's got the right angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.08,0:39:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们利用这个磁力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we use the magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来把小行星吸引到别处呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to attract the asteroids somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.08,0:39:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 朝非地球方向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As in, not towards Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.92,0:39:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,理论上讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.64,0:39:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们能把足够的磁石射向宇宙…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we can launch enough of these into space…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.16,0:39:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会使小行星偏离轨迹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will pull the asteroid off course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.60,0:39:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 拯救世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thus, saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.28,0:39:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我们需要去撞击点…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we just need to go to the crash site…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.44,0:39:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大量的的磁石射到太空中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and launch a bunch of rocks into space.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.96,0:39:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很简单 是不是？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.12,0:39:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊是啊 听起来真是小菜一碟呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Sounds like a real piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.96,0:39:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是进展！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is progress!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.60,0:39:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们明确知道该怎么办了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we know exactly what we don't know how to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧 哺乳动物们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vamanos, mammals!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.84,0:39:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着这条路一直走我们就会到达撞击点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This trail will take us directly to the crash site.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.28,0:39:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.80,0:39:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们做点有趣的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.96,0:39:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 各位 沿着这条路走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everyone. Follow the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.12,0:39:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要离开这条路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never leave the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.32,0:39:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.24,0:40:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 大家离开这条路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everyone. Leave the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.36,0:40:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,进树林 快点 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Into the forest. Chop, chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.00,0:40:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚才说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you just said…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.08,0:40:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我很神经的 快跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I'm crazy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢树荫 你们不喜欢么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the shade. Don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.32,0:40:25.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,招数不错 黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well played, weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.00,0:40:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯紧点 孩子们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay sharp, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.36,0:40:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不可能永远藏着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't hide forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.36,0:40:42.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 巴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.40,0:40:44.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么渡河的建议么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a suggestion for getting around the river?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.08,0:40:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看这远古智慧石碑如何引导我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see if the tablet's ancient wisdom will guide us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.56,0:41:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我的哺乳动物们通过！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let my mammals pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.24,0:41:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's never gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.00,0:41:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,祖先已给了我们安全的通道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ancients grant us safe passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.12,0:41:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.28,0:41:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 这里的空气有点奇怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, the air feels strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.08,0:41:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.60,0:42:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪亚哥？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Diego?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.96,0:42:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们终于有超能力了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally! We have superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.96,0:42:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.20,0:42:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在穿越一场电磁爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have wandered into an electrical storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.32,0:42:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议离树远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suggest we all stay away from the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.48,0:42:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.64,0:42:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又没走在树林里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like we're in a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.56,0:42:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 大自然母亲显然心情很不好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, Mother Nature sure is in a bad mood lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.84,0:42:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的一面是我们都可以在这里相互扶持{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good thing we're all here to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.48,0:42:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我经常说的 团结在一起才能活命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, like I always say, stay close, stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么遮挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.08,0:43:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能再蠢一点么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How stupid can you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.88,0:43:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 孩子们 俯冲！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, kids. Dive!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.44,0:43:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家尽量不要产生任何的摩擦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone, try not to create any sort of friction.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.40,0:43:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要摩擦 明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friction. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 棒棒的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yup. Cool beans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.36,0:43:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩擦是这样么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friction is what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.44,0:43:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！我们离开这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.60,0:43:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 奶奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.92,0:43:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别催我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you hurry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.20,0:43:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被雷劈的次数…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been struck by lightning more times…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.80,0:43:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！奶奶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.56,0:43:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,…比你吃的盐还多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…than you've had hot breakfasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.76,0:44:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.96,0:44:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安 别动！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian, don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.80,0:44:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有办法了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.24,0:44:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 亲爱的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming, sweetheart!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.56,0:44:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安 你为什么不帮她？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian, why aren't you helping her?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.40,0:44:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下！不 曼尼 她…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! No, Manny, she…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.76,0:44:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 你们在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.40,0:44:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮忙？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helping?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.60,0:44:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 「不帮忙」 会怎样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would "not helping" look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.76,0:44:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 爆炸头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, zapheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.28,0:44:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.60,0:44:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼 准备跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, get ready to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.44,0:44:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 我们走！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.96,0:44:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都跑出来了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.28,0:44:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,希拉 曼尼 喀什 艾迪 艾丽 奶奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shira, Manny, Crash, Eddie, Ellie, Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.36,0:44:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！我的手指不够数了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shoot! I'm out of fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:45:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克 巴克在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck. Where's Buck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.80,0:45:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.44,0:45:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.80,0:45:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面有个孩子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a baby in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.00,0:45:11.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴克 等一下！太危险了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buck, wait! It's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.36,0:45:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.80,0:45:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不能相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.48,0:45:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你我们怎么撑下去 巴克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know how we'll go on without you, Buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.12,0:45:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.32,0:45:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是巴克！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Buck!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.00,0:45:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这 别担心 我在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you. Don't worry, I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.00,0:45:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怕了 不怕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.32,0:45:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家打个招呼吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "hi, " everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.56,0:45:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.36,0:45:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是不是超可爱？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't she gorgeous?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.36,0:45:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怎么知道是女孩？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can he tell it's a she?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.20,0:45:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.32,0:45:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,多可爱的小宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a good little poochie-woochie.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.68,0:45:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是确定一下 这是个南瓜 是么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be clear, that's a pumpkin, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.88,0:46:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有点黄疸 但是我觉得她会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a little jaundice, but I think she'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.16,0:46:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.08,0:46:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我该叫你… 布朗温{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll call you… Bronwyn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.28,0:46:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 小老弟？我们需要你回到眼前的地球上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, little buddy? We need you back on planet Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.72,0:46:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,小行星还在那呢 好么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}While it's still here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.12,0:46:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的对 哺乳动物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right you are, mammal.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.44,0:46:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要从凶猛的小行星手里拯救地球呀？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to save the world from the fiery asteroid?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.12,0:46:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.64,0:46:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 哺乳动物们 我们今晚就在这休息吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, mammals. Let's stop here for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.80,0:46:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,休息？那世界末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop? What about the whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.80,0:46:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件事怎么办呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}end of the world collision thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.56,0:46:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 小行星还有一天才来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, asteroid's still a day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.64,0:46:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且正如我祖父曾说过的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like my grandfather used to say…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.28,0:46:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「早霞不出门 晚霞行千里」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Red sky at night, sailor's delight."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.24,0:46:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上出紫霞 谁动了我的搓脚油？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Purple sky at night, who moved my foot cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.48,0:46:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我需要我的搓脚油啊」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I need my foot cream."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.56,0:46:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爷爷是个糊涂易怒的黄鼠狼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grampy was a confused and angry weasel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.08,0:47:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太搞笑了 朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so funny, J.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.28,0:47:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了！你才逗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.84,0:47:07.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,放轻松 我的老虎兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy, my brother from a tiger mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.76,0:47:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,明儿见了 朱老弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hasta manana, J-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.24,0:47:13.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.80,0:47:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么那是什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.96,0:47:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个啊！是一个很酷的道别方式{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that! It's a cool way to peace out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.92,0:47:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安教我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian taught it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.16,0:47:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我很高兴世界末日联络了你俩的感情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm glad the apocalypse is bringing you together.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.64,0:47:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是一个好孩子 曼尼 我喜欢他的人生观{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a good kid, Manny. I like his philosophy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.24,0:47:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他一个机会 多和他接触一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a chance. Bond with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.76,0:47:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拆穿它们 点燃它们 毁灭他们 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ So light 'em up, up, up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.48,0:47:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拆穿它们 点燃它们 毁灭他们 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Light 'em up, up, up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.92,0:47:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拆穿它们 点燃它们 毁灭他们 以我的火之力 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Light 'em up, up, up I'm on fire ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.28,0:47:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,接触！是个不错的想法！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bonding! That's a good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.32,0:47:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.76,0:47:43.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去搞定朱利安 我有办法对付桃子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take Julian. I got an idea for Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.84,0:47:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小伙计{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bro-Kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.12,0:47:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 老伙计 你是来一起摇滚的吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Bro-Dad. You here to rock out?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.16,0:47:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 并没这个打算…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Instead of that…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.44,0:47:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是睡前来发游戏怎么样？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}how about a game before bedtime?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:48:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的假的！你想和我玩游戏？哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way! You want to play a game with me? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千倍的荣幸是多荣幸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is honored times 1, 000?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.04,0:48:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！一百万倍荣幸是多少？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Times one million?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.72,0:48:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不管是多少荣幸 我就那么荣幸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause whatever that equals, is how honored I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.48,0:48:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 就是 「同意」 了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that a "yes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.72,0:48:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 必须是 「同意」 简直不能更 「同意」 ！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's a "yes". It's the most "yes"!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.48,0:48:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是 「同意」 后面拖很长的音那种…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like "yes" with a bunch of s's…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.48,0:48:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,同意意意意意意意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it's like "yessssssssssssssssssss."
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.84,0:48:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.24,0:48:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在冰上等你！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you on the ice!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.16,0:48:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.08,0:48:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.32,0:48:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.52,0:48:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得自己准备好可以独当一面了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, do you think you're ready to go out roaming on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.36,0:48:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我一个人 我还有朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be alone. I'll have Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.68,0:48:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但是满天飞的都是小行星…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. But with asteroids flying…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.40,0:48:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,无家可归{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}no home to speak of.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且无人帮助…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and absolutely no support system…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.92,0:48:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定能应对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you think you'll be ready for…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.52,0:48:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}this?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.04,0:49:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个小北鼻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a wittle baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.40,0:49:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象一下 你在森林当中 寻找食物…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine. You're in the woods, looking for food…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.96,0:49:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的孩子生病了 你该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your baby gets sick. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.36,0:49:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.60,0:49:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,错！摇晃会让她感觉更糟糕！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Jiggling makes her feel worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.52,0:49:19.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！现在你大一点的孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! Now your older toddler.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.40,0:49:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,摔伤了膝盖还塞住了鼻子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}has a skinned knee and a stuffy nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.48,0:49:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈咪 抱抱我！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, hold me!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.88,0:49:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的孩子们都在哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now your babies are crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.36,0:49:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又没有食物而且{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no food and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.40,0:49:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了一个狂犬病兽跟你对峙！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you come face to face with a rabid beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.92,0:49:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个狂犬病兽 我会给孩子传染狂犬病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a rabid beast who gives rabies to babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.04,0:49:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个纵火犯在逍遥法外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's an arsonist on the loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.40,0:49:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有我们的帮助你要如何独自解决这一切？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you going to handle all this without our help?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.76,0:50:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,桃子 收工！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peaches, out!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.80,0:50:16.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是一些简单容易的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the easy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.36,0:50:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更多需要我们保护的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more we still need to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.16,0:50:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 北鼻拉粑粑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Baby made a poopie.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.76,0:50:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是精湛演技派的 所以请给我换尿布{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a method actor, so I will need to be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.48,0:50:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！就差一点！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! So close!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.28,0:50:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些冰球跑的好快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These pucks go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.48,0:50:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要一直盯紧冰球 直到用球棒接住它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just watch the puck all the way into the stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.12,0:50:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦！我做到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.88,0:50:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾你和桃子要搬走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad you and Peaches are moving away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.12,0:50:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们留下来 我们可以一直这样玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stayed, we could do this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.52,0:50:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我来点高难度的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Show me the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.12,0:50:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是冰球忍者！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm like a hockey ninja!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.20,0:50:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 桃子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Peaches!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.72,0:50:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,貌似你有一个新的冰球玩伴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you got a new hockey partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.64,0:50:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以取代你爸爸啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to replace your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.56,0:51:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.08,0:51:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱利安！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julian!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.48,0:51:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真是想不通 他为什么想要搬远一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a mystery why he wants to move far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.00,0:51:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是故意的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.52,0:51:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那孩子没有反应能力也不能怪我啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my fault the kid has no reflexes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.84,0:51:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样对他！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you do that to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你喜欢朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you liked Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.68,0:51:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实喜欢朱利安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do like Julian.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.84,0:51:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现的可不像啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you don't act like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.16,0:51:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把他当块拦路石一样看待他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you look at him, all you see is an obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.76,0:51:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许更糟 把他当靶子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or worse, a target.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.52,0:51:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而在我看来 他是一个温暖的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see a sweet guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.52,0:51:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽一切努力想得到你认可的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who's trying his hardest to impress you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.60,0:51:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 桃子 - 好了！你们俩 该停下了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Peaches. - No! Both of you, just stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.84,0:51:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们活下来了 我还是会结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we survive, I'm still getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.76,0:51:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是会离开家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm still leaving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.20,0:51:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们开心与否{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you're happy for me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.76,0:51:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我那种眼神 她说了 你俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give me that look. She said both.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.88,0:51:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说你也有份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.04,0:51:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后这个小小的行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this widdle astewoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.92,0:51:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就滴溜溜的 一路回家了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}went wee, wee, wee, all the way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.60,0:52:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.24,0:52:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为粑粑和他的朋友们拯救了世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because Daddy and his fwiends saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.24,0:52:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 要不是那个翼龙会飞 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And if that pterodactyl don't fly ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.96,0:52:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 粑粑就会戳瞎他剩下的那只眼睛 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Daddy's gonna blind his remaining eye ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.40,0:52:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好梦 小家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.40,0:52:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好幸运的南瓜！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.80,0:52:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个有爱的爸爸一定很棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be nice to have a loving father.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.24,0:52:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始吧 你能做到的 罗杰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here we go. You can do this, Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.40,0:52:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！绑架喽！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay! Kidnapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.92,0:52:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 但这不是我的主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look I'm sorry. It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.92,0:52:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会做这种事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would never do something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.24,0:52:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我爸爸让做的 他很疯狂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my father. He's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.76,0:52:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不相信他做到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe he pulled it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.00,0:52:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 笨蛋！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way to go, dum-dum!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.80,0:52:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 谢谢 老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Thanks, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.28,0:52:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样！我也能做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever! I could've done the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.28,0:53:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看 看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.92,0:53:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你还没阻止那个小行星啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're not stopping that asteroid now,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.64,0:53:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 黄鼠狼？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are you, weasel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.76,0:53:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.84,0:53:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是黄鼠狼 那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the Weasel. That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.04,0:53:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也不知道那是什么 - 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what that is. - Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.48,0:53:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.76,0:53:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的大限到了吗 天使？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it my time, angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.00,0:53:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,大限什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.84,0:53:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正走向光明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming to the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.88,0:53:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及要见见那些已经死去的烦人亲戚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait to see all those dead relatives I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.16,0:53:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！快下来！快下来！快下来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Get it off! Get it off! Get it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.48,0:53:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去帮帮你姐姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go help your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.96,0:53:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 爸爸…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.64,0:53:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！是恶魔天使！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahh! Demon angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.64,0:53:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢打扰你奶奶 屁股就要开花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mess with Granny, get knocked on your fanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.16,0:53:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不就完事了么 嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how it's done. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.72,0:53:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗？天使？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.32,0:53:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在天堂吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I in heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.64,0:53:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里好暗好黏糊啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so dark and squishy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.80,0:53:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.00,0:53:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不！我还是可以看见亮光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no! I can still see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.40,0:54:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老爸！我来救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop! I'll save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.76,0:54:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.84,0:54:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 也许这样对大家都好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well. Probably for the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.88,0:54:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 也许是 - 绝对是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, probably. - Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.56,0:54:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crikey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.20,0:54:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.12,0:54:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 巴克 你都干了些什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good gravy, Buck. What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.12,0:54:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 哺乳动物们 该出发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, mammals. Time to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.28,0:54:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先不要纠结这个问题 但是没错…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's not linger on this, but, yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.76,0:54:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把石碑看错了 那颗小行星离我们近了许多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read the tablet wrong. The asteroid is a lot closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.80,0:54:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.88,0:54:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 奶奶在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second. Where's Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.92,0:54:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？奶奶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Granny? Oh, Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.92,0:54:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是她走丢了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she wandered off?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.44,0:55:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定她也被冰球砸到脑袋了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe she got hit in the head with a puck?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.40,0:55:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的！也可能是只三凶狠庞大的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! And maybe she was abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.96,0:55:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙鸟为了报复我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by homicidal 30-foot dino-birds…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.80,0:55:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她掳走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeking revenge on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.40,0:55:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是不错的假设 我支持被冰球砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All good theories. I'm going to go with the puck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.64,0:55:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.24,0:55:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以一直有群巨型恐龙鸟追捕我们？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this whole time we've been chased by giant dino-birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.56,0:55:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,才三个而已！我不想打击士气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, only three! I didn't want to damage morale.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.72,0:55:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是 知道这消息之前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Because before this,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.96,0:55:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直都是无忧无虑地前进着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were on a carefree pleasure cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.00,0:55:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.56,0:55:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我闻到她的气味了 快来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got her scent. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.08,0:55:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.08,0:55:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哺乳动物们 我们到了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mammals, we've made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.96,0:55:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是撞击点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crash site.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.60,0:55:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定就是之前那颗小行星留下的残余部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be what's left of the previous asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.80,0:55:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 巴克？你的太空石！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Buck? Your space rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.96,0:55:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,以那么大的引力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could definitely divert the asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.92,0:55:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们绝对能转移小行星的轨迹！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a magnet that size!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.32,0:55:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那块石头简直是庞然大物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean that thing is enormous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.12,0:55:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直无敌大 简直…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's massive, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.48,0:55:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有任何可能搬得动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to be impossible to get off the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.96,0:56:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对有可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's entirely possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.48,0:56:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是还不知道办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a way that we don't know about yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.32,0:56:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那恐龙鸟怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about the dino-birds?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.12,0:56:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶又怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.20,0:56:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,闻不到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.52,0:56:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,真遗憾 希德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.84,0:56:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶 我温暖 毒舌的奶奶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Granny. My sweet, malicious Granny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.68,0:56:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么总是老人先走？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does it always have to be the old ones who go first?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.12,0:56:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.80,0:56:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我依然能听见她甜美 刺耳的声音…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can still hear her sweet, shrill voice…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.88,0:56:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,在天国尖叫着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}shrieking from the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.96,0:56:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶还活着！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.24,0:56:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她遇到麻烦了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's in trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.28,0:56:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.80,0:56:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奶奶？- 奶奶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Granny? - Granny?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.32,0:56:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还好吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.88,0:57:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 我也不确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.36,0:57:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我的奶奶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unhand my Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.04,0:57:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,停手我就不给你小费{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do and you don't get a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.12,0:57:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,让这只美丽的树懒开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making this beautiful sloth happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.00,0:57:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我最大的回报{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is all the payment I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.84,0:57:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看？人家浪兔子多懂事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? Hunky bunny gets it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.52,0:57:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,奶奶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Granny!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.84,0:57:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,小行星里还住着只兔子？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bunny living in the asteroid?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.68,0:57:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没预料到这茬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did not see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.20,0:57:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该来看看这个！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till you see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.08,0:57:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.36,0:57:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,弧形滑道高速旋转！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catching mad air on the half-pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.72,0:57:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.16,0:57:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得他们知不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.36,0:57:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己住在一个磁力源里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they are living in a magnetic bull's-eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.36,0:57:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不出来这里为世界末日来临{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look like a lot of.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.56,0:57:47.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,做过多少准备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}doomsday prepping going on in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.52,0:57:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我简直不能相信！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.88,0:57:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有客人！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.16,0:57:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们从来没有过客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've never had visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.84,0:57:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁能掐我一下 或者我能掐你一下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody pinch me. Or should I pinch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.72,0:57:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我还是两个都掐一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, I'll pinch both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.24,0:58:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑袋被撞了吗？这里到底发生了什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I hit my head? What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.72,0:58:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的希望这不是一个… 哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sure hope this isn't a… Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.76,0:58:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 筑梦者 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Dream Weaver ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.72,0:58:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我相信你能带我穿过黑暗 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I believe you can get me through the night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.80,0:58:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙？说真的？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy? For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.08,0:58:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.20,0:58:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 帅哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是布鲁克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.44,0:58:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么精致的骨架结构{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Such exquisite bone structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,多么强有力的下巴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a strong jaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.76,0:58:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都仙仙欲醉了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting butterflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.28,0:58:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都快恶心吐了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting nauseous.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.04,0:58:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打断你们怪异的爱情纽带…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt this weirdo love connection…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.96,0:58:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们真的有急事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we're kind of in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.60,0:58:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不尽快采取办法的话…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don't do something fast…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.16,0:58:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小行星会把我们全部炸成碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that asteroid is gonna blow us all to smithereens.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.40,0:58:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 听起来很急迫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That sounds urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.76,0:58:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最好带你们去见他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better take you to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是 「他」 ？你们的头儿？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's "him"? Your leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.76,0:58:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is our everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.44,0:58:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他洞察一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.00,0:59:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知晓一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.40,0:59:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且很好闻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And smells amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.60,0:59:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他听起来很棒 我们走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. He sounds great. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.96,0:59:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 这边请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brilliant. Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.52,0:59:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔吼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.64,0:59:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,爽！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.84,0:59:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要将您的腿和胳膊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please keep your arms and legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.92,0:59:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出飞行船外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the tram at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.48,0:59:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但请让您的思绪随意飘荡…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But allow your spirit to roam free…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.96,0:59:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在岩托邦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Geotopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.32,0:59:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我预感会很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a good feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.44,0:59:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他能帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he'll be able to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.04,0:59:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她确实说过他知晓一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She did say he knows all.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.80,0:59:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,而一切有好多好多！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.84,0:59:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.32,0:59:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,冥想大师 究极宁静{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Master of Meditation, the Supreme Serene…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.32,0:59:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,四届冥思世界冠军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the four-time Heavy Thoughts champion of the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.40,1:00:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是羊驼吗？我讨厌羊驼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a llama? I hate llamas.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.24,1:00:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们爱吐口水还特别臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They spit and smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.08,1:00:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So does she.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.24,1:00:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do we!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.84,1:00:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临 哺乳动物们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greetings, mammals!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.40,1:00:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,香格里喇嘛现在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Shangri Llama will see you…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.56,1:00:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,接见你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.88,1:00:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 太好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.32,1:00:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他在哪？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.60,1:00:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这 跟你说话呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is here. Talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.76,1:00:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我明白了 他是个口技艺人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I get it. He's a ventriloquist.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.72,1:00:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个木偶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're the dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.24,1:00:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 你是蠢蛋 - 不 你是木偶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, you're the dummy. - No, you're the dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.24,1:00:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才是蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're the dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.28,1:00:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是要拯救众生的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the guy that's going to save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.72,1:00:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 你是蠢蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look within. - You're the dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.52,1:00:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恶心了！我喜欢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disgusting! Loved that!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.68,1:00:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,新话题 我们都快要死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}New topic. We're all about to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.40,1:00:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不好 精神压力是个元凶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's no good. Stress is a killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.52,1:00:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们放松身体拥抱新知吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us loosen our limbs and open our minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.28,1:01:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,下犬式！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downward Dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.56,1:01:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃… 开玩笑呢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.08,1:01:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以等 我有全世界的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wait. I have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.64,1:01:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 你并没有全世界的时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, you don't have all the time in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.64,1:01:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没有 你看到了吗 天上有这个玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us do. You see, there's this thing in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.44,1:01:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个要把眼睛闪瞎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. That blinding light.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.04,1:01:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,每分钟都要大一圈的亮光吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that seems to get larger by the minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.80,1:01:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么了？没问题啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it? Seems fine to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.60,1:01:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的柔韧国王啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all due respect, Your Twistiness,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.60,1:01:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是个小行星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's an asteroid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.92,1:01:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被磁力吸引到了这个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's magnetically attracted to this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.92,1:01:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,并直冲我们过来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's heading straight for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.76,1:01:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aha!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.72,1:01:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定很渴望我们的磁性水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must desire our magnetic crystals.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.12,1:01:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这该怪谁？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, who can blame it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.44,1:01:35.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们确实不一般{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're really quite something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.12,1:01:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道它们可以使你永葆年轻吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know their power grants eternal youth?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.44,1:01:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经四百多岁了 没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am over 400 years old. Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.00,1:01:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这不可能 - 当然可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not possible. - Sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.80,1:01:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我326岁了 呜呼！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 326! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.68,1:01:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你看着最多275岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? You don't look a day over 275.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.08,1:01:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们年轻 快乐 安全 无忧无虑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are young, happy and safe. And we always will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.44,1:01:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢岩托邦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks to Geotopia!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.28,1:01:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了 真不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kudos. It is lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.16,1:01:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们想个办法把它发射进太空吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's figure out a way to launch it into space!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 你想摧毁我们的家园？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You want to destroy our home?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.36,1:02:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样它都会被摧毁的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be destroyed either way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.32,1:02:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是如果我们能把这个磁性物质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we propel this magnetic material.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.60,1:02:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射进大气层…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the atmosphere…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.84,1:02:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就可以改变小行星的轨迹并拯救所有人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can change the asteroid's path and save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.80,1:02:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么看？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.64,1:02:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛毛虫式！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caterpillar!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.28,1:02:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是同意？还是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is that a yes? Or…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.32,1:02:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你脊柱下方储存了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are storing a lot of hostility.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.96,1:02:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多的戾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in your lower spine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.84,1:02:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,香格里喇嘛 我们怎么才能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shangri Llama, how are we gonna…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.16,1:02:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,节奏小鸡 摇晃果冻 土豆泥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funky Chicken. Jiggy Jelly. Mashed Potato.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.00,1:02:30.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的柔韧性确实不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your flexibility is a sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.44,1:02:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到底怎么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now how the devil.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.68,1:02:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能发射这些水晶？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are we going to launch these crystals?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.28,1:02:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能 这不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.80,1:02:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼！我太累了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo! I am bushed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.48,1:02:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,很开心见到你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome meeting you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.84,1:02:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便逛逛吧 或者 随你们便吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to hang or, you know, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.00,1:02:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样了 他是我们最后的希望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. He was our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.84,1:02:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.16,1:02:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们只上了节免费瑜伽课{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. All we got was a free yoga class.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.56,1:02:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到瑜伽课…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On that subject…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.20,1:02:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们能搭把手吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}could you help me, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.88,1:02:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的鼻子和屁股要亲密接触了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My nose is dangerously close to my butt.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.80,1:03:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 希德 你为什么有两条尾巴？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Sid, why do you have two tails?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.64,1:03:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也在呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.04,1:03:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 不要哭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.72,1:03:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,往好的方面想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look on the bright side.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.48,1:03:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们过去的人生将会在眼前闪回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get to see our lives flash before our eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.20,1:03:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以再经历一次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means I get to fall in love with you…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.92,1:03:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱上你的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}all over again.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.56,1:03:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你才能把世界末日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you can make the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.68,1:03:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得像件好事一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}sound like a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.60,1:03:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把她培养的很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did a good job raising her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.84,1:03:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,她比我们知道的要更坚强{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's stronger than we know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.60,1:03:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,两天前 我愿付出一切把她留在我们身边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two days ago, I'd have given anything to keep her with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.24,1:03:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我愿付出一切看到她结婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'd give anything just to see her get married,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.52,1:03:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,并搬出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and leave home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.20,1:03:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她的孩子们玩耍 和她丈夫跳舞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Play with her kids, dance with her husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.24,1:03:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当她丈夫忘记结婚纪念日时候冲他发脾气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yell at him when he forgets their anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.20,1:03:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这很美好 不是吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good one, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.40,1:03:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的生活 你 我 还有桃子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our life. You, me, and Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.60,1:04:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这最好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.80,1:04:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 布鲁克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.60,1:04:09.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太漂亮了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.32,1:04:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把我口齿不清的毛病都治好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take my lisp away.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.08,1:04:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赌你对所有女孩说过这些话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you say that to all the girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.76,1:04:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试了 但她们通常都跑的太快了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I try. But usually they run away too fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.12,1:04:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你真是太浪漫了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're such a romantic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.08,1:04:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我知道这么说太心急了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I know this is going to sound super forward…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.48,1:04:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你想成为我的人生伴侣吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but will you be my mate for life?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.48,1:04:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁克 我不知道该说什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Brooke, I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.24,1:04:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才12分钟而已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only been twelve minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.32,1:04:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么慢？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.16,1:04:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！这是我见过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! This has been.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.84,1:04:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,最棒的世界末日了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the best last day on Earth ever.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.64,1:04:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,钻石！我需要一颗钻石{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A diamond! I need a diamond!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.48,1:04:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去哪才能找到…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where can I find a…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.84,1:04:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.92,1:04:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别别别 希德 亲爱的 别这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Sid, sweetie, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.68,1:04:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡说 要把最好的给我唯一…的…真爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense. Only the best for my one… true… love.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.00,1:05:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoopsies!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.08,1:05:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.36,1:05:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢！傻瓜！智障！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oaf! Simpleton! Nincompoop!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.48,1:05:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在和她说话还是我？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talking to her or me?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.60,1:05:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这堵墙是唯一让我们永葆年轻的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wall was the one thing keeping us young.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.16,1:05:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们都完了！完了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're all doomed! Doomed!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.20,1:05:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且现在 我觉得我发烧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, I think I have a fever.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.68,1:05:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,太谢谢了 傻子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much, doofus!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.56,1:05:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿！别激动 喇嘛！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Easy there, Llama!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.64,1:05:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这傻瓜是我的梦中情人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the doofus of my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.40,1:05:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是出于好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He meant well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.64,1:05:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 他出于好意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he meant well.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.96,1:05:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,关我什么事啊？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.84,1:05:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好的安静祥和去哪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much for serenity.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.04,1:05:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,三百年的和谐融洽…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}300 years of peace and harmony…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.40,1:05:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就被一个宇宙超级无敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}undone by one colossally, incredibly…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.72,1:05:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大傻瓜树懒毁了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}stupendously stupid sloth!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.08,1:05:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,布鲁克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.52,1:05:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！你们都老成这样了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! You guys got old.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.76,1:06:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们俩玩完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever we had, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.92,1:06:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是爱上一匹野马的后果{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happens when you date a cougar.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.76,1:06:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉 喇嘛先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry, Mr. Llama.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.88,1:06:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.60,1:06:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉可修不好这堵墙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry doesn't fix the wall now,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.04,1:06:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 你个小…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}does it, you little…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.16,1:06:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要来个泡泡浴或者按摩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a bubble bath or a massage.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.20,1:06:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁会针灸？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows acupuncture?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.56,1:06:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要把我的怒气发泄出来 发泄出来！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to let my anger out. Let it out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.60,1:06:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被压抑的太久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been pent up too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.72,1:06:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想打人 有人能把脸伸过来吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hit something. Someone give me their face.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.72,1:06:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个！被压抑的能量{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Pent-up energy.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.52,1:06:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球上最强劲的推进设备{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Earth's most powerful propulsion device.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.40,1:06:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们眼前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is right in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.92,1:06:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？这个吐痰大仙吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who? Spitty McGee here?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.88,1:06:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是火山！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The volcano!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.44,1:06:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的磁铁发射器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our magnet launcher.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.52,1:06:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要做的就是把它周围的蒸汽出口封死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need to do is seal the steam vents around it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.76,1:06:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个计划太疯狂了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a crazy plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.84,1:06:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才是疯狂计划{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a crazy plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.08,1:06:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本行不通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't even make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.72,1:06:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你又是什么？逻辑教授吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what are you? A professor of logic?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.44,1:06:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,萌萌绒猫教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Kitty McWhiskers.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.88,1:06:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就职于喵喵喵喵喵大学的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the University of Meow Meow Meow Meow…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.48,1:06:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了吗？巨大的压力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? Tremendous pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.28,1:06:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以导致巨大的爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}leads to a tremendous explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.16,1:07:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还自称教授呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you call yourself a professor.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.12,1:07:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我们需要把所有的水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. We need all the crystals.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.80,1:07:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,装到火山里去 赶快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}loaded into the volcano, pronto.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.44,1:07:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不行！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.76,1:07:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会把水晶给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving you my crystals.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.40,1:07:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要它们来重建我们的庇护所{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need them to rebuild our sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.32,1:07:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能提醒一下大家岩托邦并不属于你们吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I remind you Geotopia is not yours to keep.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.32,1:07:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you may not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.40,1:07:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是从天上来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It came from the sky,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.28,1:07:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们需要把它还回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now it's time to give it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.12,1:07:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is not!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是 你个老傻瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is too, you old coot.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.96,1:07:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变不容易 但它也是生命的一部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change isn't easy, but it's part of life.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.64,1:07:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候让我们重新去拥抱它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for us to embrace it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.00,1:07:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜欢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whether you like it or not.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.16,1:07:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.36,1:07:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 喇嘛 我要发火 烧你屁股了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Llama, I will go nuts and granola on your butt!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.84,1:07:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要么加入进来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either get on board…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.60,1:07:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么去一边把自己卷成个麻花{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or go twist yourself into a pretzel.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.80,1:07:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,别妨碍我们干活{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and na-ma-stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.68,1:07:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家来啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.16,1:07:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们所有能找到的水晶都拿上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab every crystal you can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.16,1:07:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须的 我们走吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Totally, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.12,1:07:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了 搬的时候用腿发力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, lift with your legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.96,1:07:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.32,1:07:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 星球保护小队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen up, planetary defense team.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.32,1:08:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一步 要产生压力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step one, build pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.72,1:08:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要封死火山排气孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the volcano by sealing the vents.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.00,1:08:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒸汽就不能出来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No steam can escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.16,1:08:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有泄露的地方…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a leak…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.44,1:08:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,压力就会减弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the pressure is weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.52,1:08:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二步 把最大的磁性水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step two, get the biggest magnetic crystals.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.88,1:08:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,放进火山里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}into the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.16,1:08:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把它们发射到高空中去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got to be launched sky high.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.16,1:08:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,来改变小行星原来的轨道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pull the asteroid off course.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.96,1:08:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝！- 哈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heave! - Ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.84,1:08:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喝！- 哈！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heave! - Ho!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.72,1:08:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 哇！这个要炸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rah rah! Sis boom bah!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.68,1:08:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和小行星说 「拜拜」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell that asteroid "Uh-uh."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.04,1:08:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 小行星 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Asteroid ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.20,1:08:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 标签是什么意思？∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ What does hash tag mean? ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.36,1:08:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我也不知道但听着好酷 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I don't know but it sounds cool ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.04,1:08:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 那必须 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Totally ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.16,1:08:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 别说了真够无聊 ∮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ I'm starting to get sick of it ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.36,1:08:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这了 朋友们 扔进火山口里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it, friends. Down the hatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.92,1:08:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个水晶都能起作用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every crystal counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.20,1:08:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙们 好消息！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.56,1:09:01.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比计划提前了六分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're six minutes ahead of schedule.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.60,1:09:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,冥冥之力在帮助我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody up there likes us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.36,1:09:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏消息！冥冥之力不想帮我们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news! Somebody up there doesn't like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.24,1:09:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们比计划慢了六分钟！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're six minutes behind schedule!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.64,1:09:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,加倍工作 我们需要那个大水晶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double time, everyone. We need that big crystal.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.76,1:09:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来帮你 岳父！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Hey, Bro-Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.96,1:10:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got company!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去蛋糕拿出来招待客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. I'll put out the sponge cake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.92,1:10:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.64,1:10:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞄准{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.64,1:10:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.08,1:10:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在内心真的很矛盾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really conflicted right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.80,1:10:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这还差不多 罗杰 现在了结了他吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's more like it, Roger. Now finish him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.32,1:10:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！等等 你不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Wait, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.08,1:10:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.64,1:10:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个小行星撞上来 我们都会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that asteroid hits, we all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.80,1:10:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它撞上来 我们都会死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it hits, we all die.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.80,1:10:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你出错的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.36,1:10:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们哺乳动物奔走逃命的时候…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, while you run for your mammal lives…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.64,1:10:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在高高的天空中 巡视一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be high in the sky, cruising above it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.04,1:10:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我听过最愚蠢的事了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the stupidest thing I've ever heard!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.88,1:10:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会像那些小鸟一样安全{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be as safe as those little birdies.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.16,1:10:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰巧了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.48,1:10:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太巧了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very lucky shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.12,1:11:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道 我是对的 根本就没有什么天堂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it. I was right. There's no paradise.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.68,1:11:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？这么早就灭绝 我还很年轻！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I'm too young to go extinct!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.52,1:11:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她明白了 求你了 我们时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gets it! Now, please, we haven't got much time!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.04,1:11:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还等什么？杀了他啊！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for? Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.48,1:11:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸 我不会让你这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dad. I won't let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.16,1:11:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我为什么爱着这个家吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to know what I love about our family?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.56,1:11:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们都活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.48,1:11:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你的自豪感更重要的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more important things.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.72,1:11:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许许多多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}than your pride right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.36,1:11:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你关心我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care about us…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.16,1:11:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不应该杀他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should not kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.08,1:11:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该帮助他 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should help him, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.20,1:11:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我不喜欢这么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop, I hate to say this,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.52,1:11:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我这个奇葩小弟弟可能是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my freaky little brother may be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.84,1:11:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为父亲 我愿意与宿敌合作…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a father, I would work with my worst enemy…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.52,1:11:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,以确保我的小宝宝有个更美好的未来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ensure a brighter future for my little one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.16,1:11:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,援兵来啦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reinforcements have arrived!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.88,1:12:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 罗杰 带路吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Roger. Lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.28,1:12:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！被赞同原来是这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! So that's what approval sounds like.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.76,1:12:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续飞 恐龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it up, dinos.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.28,1:12:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,用你们的侏罗纪超能力！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use that Jurassic super strength!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.36,1:12:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,哔 哔 哔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep, beep, beep.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.40,1:12:27.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 孩子们！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out, kids!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.48,1:12:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄鼠狼着陆了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weasel has landed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.08,1:12:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去把它推进去 你去找桃子和艾丽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll push it in. Go with Peaches and Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.44,1:12:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.60,1:12:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的！我们一起推！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you! We'll do this together!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.64,1:12:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 他们在哪里？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.64,1:13:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾丽 必须让大家都离开火山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellie, we've got to get everyone off the volcano.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.48,1:13:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙 蛋糕吃完了 但还有香肠！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, I'm outta cake, but I got salami!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.08,1:13:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加速！加速！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.24,1:13:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕吃完了 但还有香肠！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm outta cake, but I got salami!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.48,1:13:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 奶奶 走了！- 喂！喂！慢点儿！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Granny, come on! - Hey! Whoa! Whoa! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.48,1:13:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't working.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.20,1:13:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,弧形滑道高速旋转！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad air on the half-pipe!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.32,1:13:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼 我有办法了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, I have a plan!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.44,1:13:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,让水晶滚下去！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to let the crystal go!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.44,1:13:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们是要把水晶丢入火山吧？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we're trying to get it in the volcano, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.04,1:13:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼尼 和桃子一起生活是我唯一想要的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manny, the only thing I want is a life with Peaches.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.00,1:13:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有向你证明我自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to prove myself to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.84,1:13:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 两样东西 我要两样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, okay, two things. I want two things.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.68,1:13:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为我会浪费唯一的机会？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think I'd waste the only chance I have left?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.84,1:13:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们开始吧！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.52,1:13:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我口令 一…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my count. One…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.84,1:13:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,二…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.20,1:13:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,三！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.08,1:14:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在干什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.16,1:14:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,奏效了吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it work?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.20,1:14:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了！我收回说过一切关于你的坏话！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! I take back everything I ever said about you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.88,1:14:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.40,1:14:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们赶紧离开这里！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.80,1:15:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.08,1:15:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是暴风雨前的平静？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's the quiet before the crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.16,1:15:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.92,1:16:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 成功了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it. We did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.60,1:16:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚蛋 太空石！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your face, space rock!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.36,1:16:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 宝贝！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.76,1:16:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔呼！太棒了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo-hoo! Yeah! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.68,1:16:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要吻嘴唇 臭老头！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not on the lips, geezer!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.84,1:16:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚吧 愚蠢的石头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit the road, you stupid rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.16,1:16:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚刚终止了世界末日！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just stopped the doomsday clock!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.04,1:16:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错！哇！真好！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes! Yeah! Whoa! All right!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.68,1:16:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 过来 欢迎加入我们家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it in, Bro-Son. Welcome to the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.16,1:16:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 小疯子！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, you coconut!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.56,1:16:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不会怀疑你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never doubt you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.72,1:16:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？爸爸总是对的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? Daddy's always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.20,1:16:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你长大了也要记得{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that when you're older.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.52,1:16:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不能跟我们一起去吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you can't come with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.36,1:16:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,希德 我也想啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Sidney, I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.56,1:16:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我们都知道 这样做才是最好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we both know this is for the best.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.92,1:17:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有你的大好人生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got your whole life in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.48,1:17:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且这里有奶奶陪我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, I'll have Granny to keep me company.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.52,1:17:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也要留下吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're staying, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.52,1:17:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧？这个地方超棒的！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding? This place is great!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.68,1:17:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚有大型才艺表演 明天有裸体宾果！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's the big talent show, and tomorrow, naked bingo!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.44,1:17:14.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来吗 格拉迪斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming, Gladys?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.68,1:17:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的上了年纪可等不起了！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't getting any younger! Whoo!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.40,1:17:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我听不见你说什么！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I can't hear you!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.00,1:17:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？我听不见你说什么！- 什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? I can't hear you! - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.36,1:17:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远是我唯一真爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always be my one true love.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.92,1:17:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.92,1:17:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.08,1:17:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.88,1:17:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一模一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.04,1:17:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后就可以永远在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we'll be with each other forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.08,1:17:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 帅哥！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, handsome!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.76,1:17:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 希德！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Sidney!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.80,1:18:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,只需要补充点纤维质{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you need is more fiber.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.24,1:18:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说的对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.44,1:18:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,香格里喇嘛活力重现！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shangri Llama's back on top, baby!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.80,1:18:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉迪斯？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladys?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.84,1:18:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀 小帅哥！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hello Teddy Bear!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.12,1:18:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.80,1:18:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,浴池突然热辣了很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hot tubbin' just got a whole lot hotter.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.16,1:18:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了！这简直就是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing! It's like some kind of.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.00,1:18:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,「永葆青春泉！」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Fountain of Never Getting Old!"
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.80,1:18:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以后再研讨如何命名吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can workshop the name later.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,新娘在哪里？为什么新娘还没来？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the bride? Why don't I have the bride?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.28,1:19:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你在跟树枝说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're talking into a twig.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.32,1:19:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我不方便说话 我在参加婚礼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom, I can't talk. I'm at a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.52,1:19:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你不能说话是什么意思？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you can't talk?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.64,1:19:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和谁在一起？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you with?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.68,1:19:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 请问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.52,1:19:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真的拯救了世界不被小行星毁灭？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true you helped save the world from an asteroid?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.84,1:19:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.48,1:19:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一个非常可怕的故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very scary story.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.00,1:19:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们敢听吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.44,1:19:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.96,1:19:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多可怕？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How scary?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.52,1:19:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我们… 哦！哦！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we were… Oh! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.68,1:19:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.04,1:19:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,离午夜十二点还有五分钟…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was five minutes to midnight…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.52,1:19:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要和火山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were up against volcanoes,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.48,1:19:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙鸟 还有世界末日对决{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}dino-birds, and the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.52,1:19:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了！还有僵尸！不要忘了僵尸！{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and the zombies! Don't forget the zombies!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.20,1:19:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成为出色的父母的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'd be great parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.68,1:19:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我对着野人说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I turn to Bigfoot, and I say,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.00,1:19:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,「听着 大家伙…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Listen, big guy…"
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.52,1:19:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不知道！我该怎么办？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I don't know! What am I gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.36,1:19:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 别紧张 这很正常的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, listen to me. This is normal, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.88,1:19:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都会紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone gets nervous.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.20,1:19:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.48,1:19:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.64,1:19:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没法去 我怎么迈得出脚步？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go. How can I go?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.92,1:19:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想离开你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna leave you guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.48,1:19:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 小毛球…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Fuzzball…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.56,1:19:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我们第一次打冰球的场景吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember the first time that we played hockey?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.88,1:20:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常害怕踩到冰上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so afraid to get on the ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.68,1:20:02.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为冰太滑了？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it was slippery?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.40,1:20:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得我抱着你开始滑冰的样子吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember how I held you up while you started to skate?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.08,1:20:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我知道你准备好了 我就放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I knew you were ready, I let you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.04,1:20:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.52,1:20:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你准备好了 现在你要放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're ready. Now you have to let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.84,1:20:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直知道你需要一个特别的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew it would take someone very special.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.40,1:20:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你意气相投{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to match your spirit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.72,1:20:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你找到他了 就像我当初一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you found him. Just like I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.72,1:20:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是属于你的时刻 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your time, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.60,1:20:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去看看世界 追逐梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the world, chase your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.52,1:20:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论什么时候你决定回来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whenever you decide to come back…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.04,1:20:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都会在这里 好吗？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll be here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.92,1:20:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.60,1:21:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.96,1:21:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
